5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited for the new season! I want to see where our budget actually goes. I'll check the loan transport costs and mount-making charges!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I believe we need to be realistic about our human resources. I will look into the conservation lab staffing and the composition of the volunteer roster.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,Logic suggests we look at what actually draws a crowd. I'll examine the weekend head counts and the visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We must ensure the gallery can physically handle the exhibition. I will review the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is always a pleasure to work with you all. I worry about our deliveries, so I shall look at the lender paperwork and the maintenance log.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
