55,3,1,talk,Mio,,Candidate A is perfect! Local textiles mean low transport costs and the demonstrations are so exciting!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Candidate A fits our volunteer profile and doesn't stress the conservation lab. Candidate D is too risky given the lab's backlog.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Shion,,"Candidate A provides the human interaction the visitors crave. Candidate B has the motion, but A has the ""people"" element.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Candidate A is lightweight and easy to manage around evening bookings. Candidate B's rigging is a structural risk.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Candidate A avoids the shipping delays of Candidate C and the mechanical failures of Candidate B. It is a very safe, lovely choice.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Mio,,Everyone seems to love A! Is there any reason to consider the others?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"Not logically. D requires a working conservation bench, but our lab is already overwhelmed. It would be unfair to the staff.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Shion,,B is too sterile. C is too static. A is the only one that hits the engagement metrics.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Asuka,,I concur. A is the most compatible with the building's current constraints.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"I feel very comfortable with Candidate A. It will be a season of smiles, not apologies.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Mio,,Yay! I'm so glad we all agree!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Victoria,,It is a relief to have a decision that considers the people behind the scenes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Shion,,A logical conclusion based on the evidence.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Asuka,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Shizue,,It is wonderful when we can all work together so harmoniously.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Mio,,Let's vote!,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
